  "text_md": "## Child Psychologist Responsibilities/Duties\n\n- Study the mental and psychological development of children\n- Child counseling\n- Diagnosis and treatment of speech difficulty\n- Help a child overcome his/her limitations\n- Treat childhood learning disabilities\n- Research on child development issues\n- Counsel the whole family to help them adapt to the child with problem and help the child get well\n\n<!-- image -->",
